{"id": "31672335", "result_url": "https://cdn1.printidea.art/gallery/408180/202212262357134003o7v.jpeg", "user_id": "408180", "prompt": "Our team analyzed and calculated the requirements of the recruitment market in recent years, dividing occupations into occupations with a high education threshold, middle education threshold occupations, and low education threshold occupations. If more than 50% of jobs require a college degree or above in recruitment for a certain job, we define it as an occupation with a high education threshold; if recruitment for 20% to 50% of jobs requires a college degree or above, then we define it as an occupation with a secondary education threshold; if less than 20% of jobs require a college degree or above, it is a low education threshold occupation. Professions such as programmers, dentists, pet doctors, etc. are all high,education threshold occupations; administration, secretarial work, and securities analysis are middle education threshold occupations; while occupations such as fitness instructors, hairdressers, manicures, and eyelashes have lower education requirements at the time of recruitment and are low,level occupations,trending in artstation", "resolution_power": "512x512", "proportion": "1:1", "NSFW": "Unlikely"}
